    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It happens a couple of times a week. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. Oh, and red, cracked skin on my hands. That's been about the same, four weeks.",
